WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.342 --> 00:00:04.671
Have NO regrets!

00:00:05.428 --> 00:00:08.607
If you are afraid of starting something new

00:00:08.763 --> 00:00:10.792
if you are thinking about quitting your business

00:00:10.924 --> 00:00:12.619
if you’re having a really hard time with something

00:00:12.759 --> 00:00:15.185
having a really hard time making a decision

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:19.173
a framework that might help you is fast-forward your life

00:00:19.495 --> 00:00:21.930
to when you’re 80 years old and think back

00:00:22.095 --> 00:00:24.727
“Am I going to regret not doing this?

00:00:25.918 --> 00:00:29.906
Am I going to regret not having bet on myself and taking that chance?”

00:00:30.326 --> 00:00:32.168
If you look at people who are on their deathbed

00:00:32.427 --> 00:00:37.074
and you look at what they wish they could’ve changed on their lives

00:00:38.126 --> 00:00:40.663
the most common answer that comes back is

00:00:40.799 --> 00:00:42.727
“I regret that I didn’t take more chances.”

00:00:43.854 --> 00:00:46.843
Don’t be that person. Bet on yourself.

00:00:47.134 --> 00:00:49.894
Take your chances now while you can still take your shot.

00:00:50.361 --> 00:00:53.722
One of my favorite stories is about the founder of Amazon

00:00:54.113 --> 00:00:55.674
Jeff Bezos. When he was 30 years old

00:00:56.318 --> 00:01:00.597
he was the youngest ever Vice President at his company.

00:01:00.762 --> 00:01:02.165
It was an investment banking company.

00:01:02.445 --> 00:01:04.295
He was making a 6-figure salary

00:01:04.796 --> 00:01:07.707
and he saw the growth of the internet and he said

00:01:07.942 --> 00:01:12.660
“I’m going to do this crazy thing and start this business on the internet.

00:01:12.788 --> 00:01:15.482
I’m going to quit my job, my high-paying job

00:01:15.889 --> 00:01:20.533
move my wife to Seattle to start all over again

00:01:20.807 --> 00:01:24.004
start from scratch with nothing and start this internet company”

00:01:24.166 --> 00:01:26.818
when at the time people didn’t know about the internet.

00:01:27.121 --> 00:01:28.491
They said, “What are you doing, Jeff?

00:01:28.623 --> 00:01:29.946
What the heck are you doing?

00:01:30.082 --> 00:01:32.771
You are on the fast-track, man.

00:01:32.945 --> 00:01:36.196
You’re 30 years old, the youngest ever Vice President at this company

00:01:36.595 --> 00:01:38.259
you’re making 6 figure salary

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:41.455
why would you throw it all away to start this thing on the internet?

00:01:41.518 --> 00:01:43.119
What’s the internet? Are you kidding me?”

00:01:43.464 --> 00:01:47.386
And what helped him make that difficult decision was that

00:01:47.611 --> 00:01:51.196
he didn’t want to live his life with regret.

00:01:52.297 --> 00:01:54.263
Here’s one of my favorite quotes from him as he

00:01:54.454 --> 00:01:56.668
was explaining this decision that he had to go through.

00:01:57.040 --> 00:02:00.302
“So I wanted to project myself forward to age 80 and say

00:02:00.595 --> 00:02:02.239
‘Okay, now I’m looking back on my life.

00:02:02.694 --> 00:02:05.693
I want to have minimized the number of regrets I have.

00:02:06.161 --> 00:02:08.903
And you know, I knew that when I was 80

00:02:09.328 --> 00:02:12.476
I was not going to regret having tried this.

00:02:12.849 --> 00:02:18.694
I was not going to regret trying to participate in this thing called the Internet

00:02:18.857 --> 00:02:20.693
that I thought was going to be a really big deal.

00:02:21.053 --> 00:02:23.750
I knew that if I failed I wouldn't regret that

00:02:24.266 --> 00:02:28.333
but I knew the one thing I might regret is not ever having tried.

00:02:28.802 --> 00:02:31.514
And I knew that that would haunt me every day.”

00:02:31.775 --> 00:02:34.793
So have no regrets. Bet on yourself.

00:02:35.068 --> 00:02:36.940
Take your shot while you still can

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:38.812
and believe.

00:02:38.812 --> 00:02:40.686
You guys liked this video,

00:02:40.846 --> 00:02:42.575
let me know what your shot is

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:44.298
let me know how you’re betting on yourself

00:02:44.464 --> 00:02:45.529
and you’re not living with regrets.

00:02:45.672 --> 00:02:46.864
Leave a comment below.

00:02:46.966 --> 00:02:48.465
You liked the video, give it a thumbs-up.

00:02:48.625 --> 00:02:50.550
And click on my face to subscribe to the channel.

00:02:50.651 --> 00:02:52.341
Thank you so much, I’ll see you soon.

